​Pallet Mathematics – // and %
​The production engineer's favourite operators  
​// · FLOOR DIVISION · "FULL BOXES"  
​Concept: How many complete boxes of 12 from 137 parts? Divide and throw away the fraction.  
​Example: 137 // 12 \rightarrow 11 (11 full boxes, guaranteed int).  
​% · MODULO · "LOOSE PARTS"  
​Concept: How many parts are left over, sitting loose on the bench? The remainder.  
​Example: 137 % 12 \rightarrow 5 (5 loose parts – order a 12th box or not?).  Try It - Fill the Operator
